    showCg: 0
    cgNum: 0
    minigameType: 0
  - cn: "\u60F3\u542C\u542C\u4F60\u5BF9\u5176\u4ED6\u4EBA\u7684\u770B\u6CD5\u3002"
    en: I want to hear what you think of the others.
    cnHaveBranch: 0
    cnBranch: []
    enHaveBranch: 0
    enBranch: []
    isPlayerTalking: 1
    isAside: 0
    codes: 
    onlyCode: 0
    speaker: 0
    expression: 0
    showCg: 0
    cgNum: 0
    minigameType: 0
  - cn: "\u867D\u8BF4\u6211\u786E\u5B9E\u6BD4\u4F60\u65E9\u5165\u961F\u4E86\u90A3\u4E48\u4E00\u70B9\u70B9\u65F6\u95F4\uFF0C\u4F46\u548C\u5176\u4ED6\u4EBA\u76F8\u5904\u7684\u65F6\u95F4\u6211\u4EEC\u660E\u660E\u5DEE\u4E0D\u4E86\u591A\u5C11\u3002"
    en: Although I did join the team just a tiny bit earlier than you, the time we
      have spent with the others is clearly not that different.
    cnHaveBranch: 0
    cnBranch: []
    enHaveBranch: 0
    enBranch: []
    isPlayerTalking: 0
    isAside: 0
    codes: 
    onlyCode: 0
    speaker: 4
    expression: 0
    showCg: 0
    cgNum: 0
    minigameType: 0
  - cn: "\u542C\u542C\u522B\u4EBA\u7684\u60F3\u6CD5\u6CA1\u4EC0\u4E48\u574F\u5904\u3002"
    en: There is nothing wrong with hearing someone else's thoughts.
    cnHaveBranch: 0
    cnBranch: []
    enHaveBranch: 0
    enBranch: []
    isPlayerTalking: 1
    isAside: 0
    codes: 
    onlyCode: 0
    speaker: 4
    expression: 0
    showCg: 0
    cgNum: 0
    minigameType: 0
  - cn: "\u554A\uFF0C\u6211\u61C2\u6211\u61C2\uFF0C\u4F5C\u4E3A\u9886\u5BFC\u8005\u81EA\u7136\u9700\u8981\u4ECE\u4E0D\u540C\u89D2\u5EA6\u4E86\u89E3\u4E0B\u5C5E\u4EEC\u3002"
    en: Ah, I get it, I get it. As a leader, of course you need to understand your
      subordinates from different angles.
    cnHaveBranch: 0
    cnBranch: []
    enHaveBranch: 0
    enBranch: []
    isPlayerTalking: 0
    isAside: 0
    codes: 
    onlyCode: 0
    speaker: 4
    expression: 0
    showCg: 0
    cgNum: 0
    minigameType: 0
  - cn: "\u81EA\u6211\u4ECB\u7ECD\u5148\u514D\u53BB\u2026\u2026\u6211\u5E76\u4E0D\u64C5\u957F\u8BC4\u4EF7\u81EA\u5DF1\u3002"
    en: ' I will skip introducing myself first... I am not good at evaluating myself.'
    cnHaveBranch: 0
    cnBranch: []
    enHaveBranch: 0
    enBranch: []
    isPlayerTalking: 0
    isAside: 0
    codes: 
    onlyCode: 0
    speaker: 4
    expression: 0
    showCg: 0
    cgNum: 0
    minigameType: 0
  - cn: "\u8BA9\u6211\u60F3\u60F3\u2026\u2026\u8FD8\u662F\u4ECE\u5165\u961F\u987A\u5E8F\u5F00\u59CB\u5427\u3002"
    en: Let me think... I will start with the order in which everyone joined the
      team.
    cnHaveBranch: 0
    cnBranch: []
    enHaveBranch: 0
    enBranch: []
    isPlayerTalking: 0
    isAside: 0
    codes: 
    onlyCode: 0
    speaker: 4
    expression: 0
    showCg: 0
    cgNum: 0
    minigameType: 0
  - cn: "\u8001\u4E9A\u6469\u65AF\uFF0C\u6211\uFF0C\u961F\u957F\u4F60\u2026\u2026\u7136\u540E\u5C31\u662F\u963F\u66FC\u5FB7\u4E86\u5427\u3002"
    en: Amos, me, you, Captain... and then Amanda, I suppose.
    cnHaveBranch: 0
    cnBranch: []
    enHaveBranch: 0
    enBranch: []
    isPlayerTalking: 0
    isAside: 0
    codes: 
    onlyCode: 0
    speaker: 4
    expression: 0
    showCg: 0
    cgNum: 0
    minigameType: 0
  - cn: "\u961F\u957F\uFF0C\u4F60\u522B\u770B\u963F\u66FC\u5FB7\u5E73\u65F6\u6E29\u6E29\u67D4\u67D4\u7684\uFF0C\u8C01\u8981\u662F\u60F9\u4E86\u5979\uFF0C\u7EDD\u5BF9\u6CA1\u6709\u597D\u679C\u5B50\u5403\u3002"
    en: Captain, do not be fooled by how gentle Amanda usually seems. If anyone makes
      her angry, they absolutely will not have a good time.
    cnHaveBranch: 0
    cnBranch: []
    enHaveBranch: 0
    enBranch: []
    isPlayerTalking: 0
    isAside: 0
    codes: 
    onlyCode: 0
    speaker: 4
    expression: 4
    showCg: 0
    cgNum: 0
    minigameType: 0
  - cn: "\u81F3\u4E8E\u827E\u7C73\u8389\u548C\u535A\u91D1\u68EE\u2026\u2026\u4ED6\u4FE9\u592A\u5B64\u50FB\u4E86\uFF0C\u813E\u6C14\u8FD8\u81ED\uFF0C\u4E5F\u4E0D\u662F\u4EC0\u4E48\u5584\u832C\uFF0C\u63CD\u6211\u7684\u65F6\u5019\u4ECE\u6765\u6CA1\u6709\u987E\u53CA\u8FC7\u4EC0\u4E48\u540C\u4F34\u60C5\u8C0A\u3002"
    en: As for Emily and Bokinson... those two are too withdrawn, and their tempers
      are awful. They are not exactly harmless either. When they hit me, they never
      showed any concern for team friendship.
    cnHaveBranch: 0
    cnBranch: []
    enHaveBranch: 0
    enBranch: []
    isPlayerTalking: 0
    isAside: 0
    codes: 
    onlyCode: 0
    speaker: 4
    expression: 6
    showCg: 0
    cgNum: 0
    minigameType: 0
  - cn: "\u8FD9\u6837\u770B\uFF0C\u6211\u4EEC\u961F\u91CC\u53EA\u6709\u6D1B\u5C14\u574E\u597D\u76F8\u5904\u4E00\u70B9\u4E86\u3002"
    en: Looking at it that way, Lorquin is the only one in our team who is a little
      easier to get along with.
    cnHaveBranch: 0
